    "body": "claimed: main session (review fixes for PR #105) · 2026-11-07T18:15Z · branch issue/96-vertical-rapid-into-stock · plan: the independent review BLOCKED the merge: (1) the new law ignores what earlier ops of the setup removed (verify's surface_before = this op's own cuts min the raw stock top), so face-then-contour and pocket-then-drill programs, which post today, would be refused - feed the setup's prior rest surface (the app's PriorState / rest grid) into the column reading; (2) the pocket3d_hsm fixture change lowered the verify stock top and hid a real dive through stock the same file declares - make the fixture consistent instead. Also: module doc in verify/mod.rs still says vertical rapids are exempt; a unit test that the turning carve-out keeps sideways convictions. Tool-width blind spot -> #106.",
